      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OKAY BOSS (6) hit the ground running from out wide last start and crossed down to lead throughout (34.81) at this track in a Restricted WIN over 595m. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. MISS SPARKLES (1) flew the lids with a fast early split and went on to clock 31.27 when a 1.3 lengths winner over 545m at Ballarat. Some good form is emerging from her last run. One of the leading chances again. YOUNG RUFUS (8) missed the frame last time when fourth (26.08) at Warragul but prior to that had four placings in a row. Has never missed the frame at the trip from three starts. Should be about the money. LITTLE BONT (2) can measure up with the right run.",
